ssion.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/retro", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"scaffold-exercises", Name:"scaffold-exercises", Description:"Create exercise directory structures with sections, problems, solutions, and explainers that pass linting. Use when user wants to scaffold exercises, create exercise stubs, or set up a new course section.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/scaffold-exercises", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"semantic-compression", Name:"semantic-compression", Description:"Re-encode verbose prose into a dense telegraphic register — punctuation as connectives, label frames, verbless assertions — without losing normativity or precision. Use when compressing system prompts, tool/function descriptions, skill bodies, or agent instructions; reducing token count or context bloat; making documentation token-efficient for LLM input; or rewriting text in compressed notation.", SourcePath:"~/.agents/skills/semantic-compression", Provider:"mcode", Root:"universal", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"setup-matt-pocock-skills", Name:"setup-matt-pocock-skills", Description:"Configure this repo for the engineering skills: set up its issue tracker, triage label vocabulary, and domain doc layout. Run once before first use of the other engineering skills.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/setup-matt-pocock-skills", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"setup-pre-commit", Name:"setup-pre-commit", Description:"Set up Husky pre-commit hooks with lint-staged (Prettier), type checking, and tests in the current repo. Use when user wants to add pre-commit hooks, set up Husky, configure lint-staged, or add commit-time formatting/typechecking/testing.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/setup-pre-commit", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"setup-ts-deep-modules", Name:"setup-ts-deep-modules", Description:"Wire dependency-cruiser into a TypeScript repo so each package is a deep module, with implementation hidden in subfolders and reachable only through its entry-point files. User-invoked.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/setup-ts-deep-modules", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"stitch-design-taste", Name:"stitch-design-taste", Description:"Semantic Design System Skill for Google Stitch. Generates agent-friendly DESIGN.md files that enforce premium, anti-generic UI standards — strict typography, calibrated color, asymmetric layouts, perpetual micro-motion, and hardware-accelerated performance.", SourcePath:"~/.agents/skills/stitch-design-taste", Provider:"mcode", Root:"universal", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:2}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"system-prompts", Name:"system-prompts", Description:"Write system prompts, tool docs, and agent definitions. Project tag conventions + RFC 2119 keywords + dense compression. Use when authoring or editing any prompt the model reads.", SourcePath:"~/.agents/skills/system-prompts", Provider:"mcode", Root:"universal", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:2}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"systematic-debugging", Name:"systematic-debugging", Description:"Use when encountering any bug, test failure, or unexpected behavior, before proposing fixes", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/systematic-debugging", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"tavily-search", Name:"tavily-search", Description:"Search the web with LLM-optimized results via the Tavily CLI. Use this skill when the user wants to search the web, find articles, look up information, get recent news, discover sources, or says \"search for\", \"find me\", \"look up\", \"what's the latest on\", \"find articles about\", or needs current information from the internet. Returns relevant results with content snippets, relevance scores, and metadata — optimized for LLM consumption. Supports domain filtering, time ranges, and multiple search depths.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/tavily-search", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"tdd", Name:"tdd", Description:"Test-driven development. Use when the user wants to build features or fix bugs test-first, mentions \"red-green-refactor\", or wants integration tests.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/tdd", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"teach", Name:"teach", Description:"Teach the user a new skill or concept, within this workspace.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/teach", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"to-questionnaire", Name:"to-questionnaire", Description:"Turn a decision you can't fully answer into a questionnaire for someone else to fill in.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/to-questionnaire", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"to-spec", Name:"to-spec", Description:"Turn the current conversation into a spec and publish it to the project issue tracker: no interview, just synthesis of what you've already discussed.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/to-spec", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"to-tickets", Name:"to-tickets", Description:"Break a plan, spec, or the current conversation into a set of tracer-bullet tickets, each declaring its blocking edges, published to the configured tracker (edges as text in one file per ticket locally, or native blocking links on a real tracker).", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/to-tickets", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"triage", Name:"triage", Description:"Move issues and external PRs through a state machine of triage roles, categorise, verify, grill if needed, and write agent-ready briefs.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/triage", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"wait-what", Name:"wait-what", Description:"Stop. That last message did not land: re-pitch it.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/wait-what", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"wayfinder", Name:"wayfinder", Description:"Plan a huge chunk of work (more than one agent session can hold) as a shared map of decision tickets on your issue tracker, and resolve them one at a time until the way to the destination is clear.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/wayfinder", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"wizard", Name:"wizard", Description:"Generate an interactive bash wizard that walks a human through steps only they can perform. Use when provisioning infrastructure, setting up credentials or CI secrets, walking an unfamiliar third-party dashboard, or running a one-off migration or cutover. Don't invoke this for steps the agent can perform itself.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/wizard", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"writing-beats", Name:"writing-beats", Description:"Writing, exploit; assemble raw material into a journey of beats, grounding each term before a beat leans on it.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/writing-beats", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"writing-for-agents", Name:"writing-for-agents", Description:"Writing documents for agents. Use when creating or editing skills, or modifying AGENTS.md or CLAUDE.md.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/writing-for-agents", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"writing-fragments", Name:"writing-fragments", Description:"Writing, explore: mine raw fragments, no structure yet.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/writing-fragments", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"writing-plans", Name:"writing-plans", Description:"Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/writing-plans", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"writing-shape", Name:"writing-shape", Description:"Writing, exploit: shape raw material into an article, paragraph by paragraph.", SourcePath:"~/.minimax/skills/writing-shape", Provider:"mcode", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}}
